    {
      "id": "claim_ebad073c8dc442e991139e44c068c029",
      "statement": "The login route hard-codes the documented development credential as the DEV_CREDENTIAL constant rather than reading ADMIN_EMAIL/ADMIN_PASSWORD, and when env.ALLOW_DEV_CREDENTIAL is false it refuses that pair before calling GoTrue through the same unified denial path as every other failure (250 ms delay, 401 UNAUTHORIZED \"Invalid email or password\", throttler failure record, security.sign_in_failure event); when the flag is true the pair is still signed in against GoTrue and must pass the admin_users check.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://apps/server/src/api/auth-login.ts#L20-L24",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:1a01c8829f8105ef3a11e73b614e4bfbaca8483ecd49901c82b26de65698562a:"
