      "statement": "MAPBOX_SECRET_TOKEN is the only optional server variable and is read by the Directions proxy handler through a fresh loadEnv(process.env) call on every request instead of from AppDeps.env; a falsy token (absent, or an empty value in .env) returns straight-line geometry with snapped:false and warning \"no_token\", and that per-request parse is what lets the unit tests flip the token by mutating process.env.",
