      "statement": "apps/admin documents exactly one environment variable, VITE_API_URL, which is consumed as the axios baseURL via import.meta.env.VITE_API_URL; nothing validates it, so an unset value leaves the client resolving requests against the SPA's own origin without failing the build, and VITE_SUPABASE_URL / VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY are documented as deliberately unused because authentication is backend-proxied.",
