      "statement": "The komyuter-csp plugin in apps/admin/vite.config.ts emits a single <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Security-Policy\"> at head-prepend only when config.mode === \"production\" (transformIndexHtml returns undefined otherwise), so dev mode deliberately has no CSP because Vite HMR needs inline scripts and styles, and the static index.html ships none.",
