    {
      "id": "claim_2c35b07445c5483cae5be583e969a1f4",
      "statement": "The injected policy is default-src/script-src/style-src 'self', worker-src 'self' blob:, img-src 'self' data: blob: https://tiles.openfreemap.org, font-src 'self' data:, connect-src 'self' https://tiles.openfreemap.org plus an API origin derived at build time from VITE_API_URL (read through Vite's loadEnv(config.mode, process.cwd(), \"\"), reduced with new URL(raw).origin, kept as the raw string when it does not parse, and omitted entirely when unset), object-src 'none', base-uri 'self', form-action 'self' — with no 'unsafe-inline' or 'unsafe-eval' anywhere.",
